POST http://localhost:8080/api/validation

{
  "dtoType": "USER",
  "validationType": "USER_CREATE",
  "data": {
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Smith",
    "email": "john@gmail.com",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "password": "password123",
    "confirmPassword": "password123",
    "age": 25
  }
}

Dynamic field example:

{
  "dtoType": "USER",
  "validationType": "USER_UPDATE",
  "additionalFields": {
    "firstName": "required"
  },
  "data": {
    "firstName": "",
    "email": "john@gmail.com",
    "phone": "9876543210",
    "age": 25
  }
}
